WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.525
Substrate, live: kill it, then reopen it.

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:09.475
Build a project world. Nest an experiment with a delegated budget.

00:00:10.675 --> 00:00:15.150
Start the worker.  Kill minus nine, mid-run.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.600
Reopen. Artifacts byte-identical. Ledger intact. The task finishes.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.275
Fuse two worlds, with lineage. Export a composite that runs elsewhere.

00:00:29.475 --> 00:00:34.175
The receipt: killed, zero re-executed, byte-identical, portable.

00:00:35.975 --> 00:00:40.950
Alpha honesty: process crash only. Power loss is a different claim.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.275
Five commands.  Try the kill yourself.
